1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:01,667
(Sheldon:)Forgot my keys.

2
00:00:08,242 --> 00:00:10,122
(Howard(on phone):)Okay, great. Bye.

3
00:00:11,111 --> 00:00:13,951
Our friendly neighborhood scalper
says he's running late.

4
00:00:14,548 --> 00:00:16,118
(Raj:)Does he sound like a criminal?

5
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:19,228
(Howard:)What do you mean?

6
00:00:19,386 --> 00:00:24,766
(Raj:)You know, did he say things like,
"Youse guys," or "Listen here, see?"

7
00:00:27,795 --> 00:00:31,075
Yes. He's late because
he's on his way here from 1940.

8
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:34,943
(Raj:)I'm just saying.
We don't know who this guy is.

9
00:00:35,102 --> 00:00:37,082
(Raj:)What if he wants to steal
our money or our kidneys,

10
00:00:37,237 --> 00:00:39,277
or make a suit out of our skins?

11
00:00:40,441 --> 00:00:43,421
(Howard:)Why would someone want to make
clothes out of your skin?

12
00:00:43,577 --> 00:00:46,787
(Raj:)I don't know. Maybe 'cause
dark doesn't show the stains?

13
00:00:49,149 --> 00:00:50,819
(Leonard:)Now you're making me wonder
if we should have met him

14
00:00:50,984 --> 00:00:52,154
(Leonard:)at a neutral location.

15
00:00:52,319 --> 00:01:04,019
(Howard:)Why do you think I told him
to come to your place?

